OL,3,GNEWSAFestival's neighbours 'feel like
OL,4,Aprisoners in our own homes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed with bucket hats, pop-up tents
OL,7,Fand glitter, thousands of music fans
OL,8,Fwill party to the sounds of Swedish
OL,9,FHouse Mafia and Underworld at
OL,10,FCreamfields over the August bank
OL,11,Fholiday weekend.
OL,13,FUp to 80,000 people will descend on the
OL,14,Fsmall Cheshire village of Daresbury for
OL,15,Fthe four-day dance festival from
OL,16,FThursday to Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
