OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFestival's neighbours 'feel like
OL,4,Aprisoners in our own homes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut some local residents have bemoaned
OL,7,Fthe "nightmare" 10-mile traffic queues
OL,8,Fand drunken fans trying to break into
OL,9,Ftheir gardens. Some said they had been
OL,10,Fgiven 24-hour guards and cash
OL,11,Fcompensation. One resident, Ian
OL,12,FBrittain, said: "It causes chaos - we
OL,13,Ffeel like prisoners in our own homes.
OL,14,FWe are scared to leave."
OL,16,FCreamfields' organisers have been
OL,17,Fcontacted for comment.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
